Put any application resources (e.g., icons and resources) here;
they can be referenced in code as "resources/folder_name_here/your_image.png"

An example of this (using os)

# this will give you the absolute path to the current file you're in, but instead points to resources folder
self.resource_path = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), 'resources')

# with the path above, you can access any file you may need within resources ( which is how Briefcase requires
# resource collection )
